Description:

Fix CalDAV scheduling on servers running with virtdomains enabled and a
defaultdomain configured: an invitation stored by a user of the default
domain was not scheduled at all, because the organizer's own address was
taken for another user's.

Documentation:

No documentation change: the fix restores the documented behaviour.

